<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 118,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 118,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual 118,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts sold mostly $0.50 lower than mid-session Tuesday. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 51.00 -52.00	   52.00 -53.00</p>
<p>few			   52.50 -53.00	   53.50 -54.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     40.00 -43.00	   41.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		43.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		 46.00 -48.00	   48.00 -49.00</p>
